	KenneyTextures: every Kenney Particle Pack (CC0, kenney.nl) image uploaded to Roblox, by its
	original file name → "rbxassetid://<id>". Uploaded by the owner on 2026-11-05 through Asset
	Manager (Image ids, not Decal ids). DomainFx.UPLOADED picks from here by name, so trying a
	different texture for a role is a one-word change there.

	Names match the files in the pack (a contact sheet of them: assets/vfx/kenney/). `_rotated`
	variants are the pack's 90°-rotated copies (useful for streaks that should run horizontally).
	A name missing here simply isn't uploaded; DomainFx then keeps its built-in fallback.
]]

